        <mxCell id="p3_evidence" value="依据：Docs/Design/玩法流程.md；AtelierGameplay.cs（Observe／Say／AfterStillLife 等）；AtelierContinuationInput.cs（Pick／Pointer）；AtelierRules.cs（配方门槛）；AtelierNarration.cs；NarrationSystem.cs；AtelierPlayable.unity。&lt;br&gt;本图是当前代码与场景配置的静态流程评估；没有把自动回放当作真人鼠标直觉验收。" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1f2937;" vertex="1" parent="1">
